<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"You really weren't alone."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> with me, I went into the house.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Huh? The lights were on in the house.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sure enough, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had come home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A lie that turned out to be true...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm hooome."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There was no answer from inside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But from the living room came the sound of the television.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Sorry to intrude..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> gave her greeting in a small voice.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="のぞ">peek</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">ed into the living room, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was sprawled out on the sofa.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Her hair seemed to have changed color again...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I greeted </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> flatly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, huh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> answered brazenly.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Barely started high school and already out at night..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is never home either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm 20 already."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You haven't been home since high school..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I quit high school right away."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> kept her face to the television and answered curtly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We speak for the first time in a while, and it is always like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seems to have been drifting around amusing herself ever since she dropped out in her first year of high school.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Honestly, she has a bit of a delinquent air, and it scares me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Not that I dislike her; she is just hard for me to deal with.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She has not been in the hands of the police yet, as far as I know, but how long is she going to go on like this?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I brought a </STYLE>friend<STYLE ID="3"> over."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Uh... excuse me, sorry to intrude."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> leaned in from the side.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Oh, I'm sorry, dressed like this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There's nothing much in our house, but please make yourself at home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> answered in a suddenly friendly voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That exchange just now had been heard perfectly clearly by </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, I thought...</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "232" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Let's go."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s hand I pulled.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was she feeling ill at ease after that ugly exchange between us sisters...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s hand I pulled, and climbed the stairs.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">We went into my room, and I sat </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> down on the bed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She looked as though all her strength had gone out of her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, if you're tired, we could leave this until tomorrow?</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You're welcome to stay over."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
There's no time..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">True enough, it was a fact that we could not let our guard down until April 8 was over.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">From here on, I have to steel myself as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Now then, Part 2 of the Operation begins.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Understood. Then please tell me whatever you can, however it comes to you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You don't need to put it in order."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> nodded without a word.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, I'm sorry, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">. Let me ask you one thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> turned her face toward me without a word.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You said there's no time, but how much time is left?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was staring steadily at me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Right now, <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE> could die...
{PAUSE ""}
But if she can hold out until midnight..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I looked at the clock. It was 20:50.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A little over 3 hours left.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">By then I have to undo </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s conviction... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, I myself reckon that this April 8 is suspicious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Getting information that could be a clue out of </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> as early as possible is part of the Operation too.</STYLE><PG>
"Uh... uh...
{PAUSE ""}
You probably won't believe me, but..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> began to speak slowly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She prefaced it again, and I listened to </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> without looking away from her face.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I...
{PAUSE ""}
I...
{PAUSE ""}
I cast a curse..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A curse..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"A curse...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A curse..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That curse?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That curse..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A strange round of question and answer went on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> had started saying something entirely off the mark, and I was a little at a loss.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\呪いイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―A curse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In this case, it must mean that by some fantastical means, a person can deliberately kill another.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, something like that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There is no way curses exist...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\魔女狩りイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Long ago there were apparently witch hunts and black magic and the like, but in this day and age you never hear of them at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if they do exist, at best they end up as cultural heritage or as material for a made-up story.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Honestly, it is easy to deny curses completely by logic.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But if I deny the so-called curse here, there is a chance of an unexpected loss of time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I should avoid arguing back as much as I can.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, I have to manage my agreeing noises and my questions well, so that I can draw the information I need out of her in the shortest time possible.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That curse, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, you were the one who cast it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So that no feeling would enter the question, I adjusted my </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="こわいろ">tone of voice</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">But when I said that, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> fell silent again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I rubbed </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You don't have to say anything you don't want to say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Just tell me the parts you can tell."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At that, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> let out a long breath.</STYLE><PG>
"The first time I cursed someone to death was in a place called Megasawa City, where I lived 10 years ago...
{PAUSE ""}
I just... couldn't stand it anymore."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Megasawa City...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Megasawa City... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The place where the Megasawa City murders happened, that one?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The reason I decided to investigate this incident in the first place was that I was bothered by its connection to the incidents that happen in this Megasawa City every few years.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I remember right, I should have that note somewhere...</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "7" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, first let me hear </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s story.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see... that must have been hard."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I could more or less follow the story.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Some kind of trouble had occurred in Megasawa City.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> could not stand it and cast a curse on the person who was the root cause. That must be what she means.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But 10 years ago...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> would only just have started elementary school then, I would think...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Well, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s curse and the Megasawa City murders are probably separate matters...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, but 10 years ago is exactly the year the first of the Megasawa City murders happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s April 8, the day she is worried about, is the date the Megasawa City murders happen too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It can't be... there is no way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">First, let me listen to her without preconceptions.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"In this incident too, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, did you cast a curse on </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and her family?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
Probably...
{PAUSE ""}
I think I did cast it."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Probably, you say..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A thoroughly vague answer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If she had declared here that she cast a curse, I could have asked "Is there no way to undo it?" but...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, if it could be undone in the first place, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> would not have come to me for advice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, there is no way to undo it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What do you mean, probably?"</STYLE>
