<STYLE ID="1">And then... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I see, so the person whose name is written on this paper figure dies.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But the strange staining all over them bothered me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Call it stains, call it grime, they were awfully dirty.</STYLE><PG>
