<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So the figures were made sometime between last night and this morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The reason </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> is carrying these now must be that she meant to show them to the police as evidence.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But there is a large contradiction in this paper-figure curse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If she hears it, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> should realize that this is a sham.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Still, it is probably better not to show her a smile yet.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">? </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had lied yesterday evening about going away on business, hadn't he?</STYLE>
