<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All at once </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> raised her voice, and with a terrible look on her face she </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="にら">glar</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">ed at me.</STYLE>
