<STYLE ID="1">That is strange...! That is too neat to be true!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In the first place, bringing something up on purpose might be possible if you stuck your fingers down your throat, but then she would surely wake up.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"S... </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">?</STYLE>
