<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And since she said just now that she had a motive and was put through police questioning, there can be no evidence at all that </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> killed anyone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">As I thought, it is a stretch to suppose that </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> cursed them to death.</STYLE>
