"Huh?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, is that okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the other end of the line, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed to be asking </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">her mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, can you hear me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Do come over. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> will feel safer that way too, won't she?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice reached me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thank goodness! To be honest, I was uneasy myself with just </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> and me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ahaha, were you uneasy with only </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="5"> around?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　We'll be home soon, so call when you get close!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> and I agreed to go to the Kogori house, and I ended the call.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Hey <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, what are you playing at?
{PAUSE ""}
I don't know what I might do in front of <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE>!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That is exactly why. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'm sure </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> has never once watched a person die from a curse, has she?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　So please make sure with your own eyes that there is no such thing as a curse. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I have no part in it, and I will be present as a witness too."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> seemed a little irritated that her feelings were not getting through completely.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But―</STYLE><PG>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
Haah... all right.
{PAUSE ""}
If <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> is going to say that much, I'll bet on what <STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE> say.
{PAUSE ""}
I've started to want to know myself. What the curse really is..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thank goodness! Then let's hurry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is waiting."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I stood up and pulled </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> up by the hand.</STYLE>
